{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","凛冬战歌"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤暴风雪降低对方急速并造成持续伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，寒冬伴随阿尔娜降临战场，降低除阿尔娜外的所有单位40急速和2格射程。\n主动释放时，阿尔娜发出战吼引发暴风雪，暴风雪将清空所有敌人的急速增益且每0.5秒对全场敌人造成40% + 6% ATK伤害，持续8秒。在此期间，暴风雪将暂时屏蔽自身和“凛冬战士”的痛觉，当其受到伤害时，会在后续10秒内逐渐恢复本次失去的50% + 5%生命值。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":91,"end":96,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":162,"end":167,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":88,"end":100,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至45% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至50% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至55% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至60% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","同仇敌忾"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","任命“凛冬战士”并使其获得增益。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","布阵时与阿尔娜处于同排的一名友军将晋升为“凛冬战士”，“凛冬战士”免疫“凛冬战歌”带来的急速减益效果，并且永久提高15% + 1.5%生命上限。\n主动释放时，阿尔娜使用长矛穿刺敌人造成340% + 40% ATK伤害，并为自己和“凛冬战士”恢复伤害量100% + 10%的生命。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":60,"end":67,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":96,"end":102,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":129,"end":135,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":92,"end":106,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至360% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至380% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至400% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","寒霜战舞"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","挥动长矛对周围敌人造成伤害，并降低目标急速。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","连续挥动长矛，对1格扇形范围内的敌人造成2次120% + 15% ATK伤害，随后横扫周围1格范围内的所有敌人造成240% + 30% ATK伤害，并降低敌人-50点急速，持续8秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":32,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":61,"end":67,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":36,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":57,"end":71,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","前两段攻击造成的伤害提升至130% + 15% ATK，最后一击造成的伤害提升至260% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":44,"end":50,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":40,"end":54,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","前两段攻击造成的伤害提升至140% + 15% ATK，最后一击造成的伤害提升至280% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":44,"end":50,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":40,"end":54,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","前两段攻击造成的伤害提升至150% + 15% ATK，最后一击造成的伤害提升至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":44,"end":50,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":40,"end":54,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","降低自身受到的伤害，随着战斗时间延长额外降低自身受到的伤害。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身受到的伤害降低10%，战斗每持续10秒，额外提升5%减伤，至多叠加5层。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身受到的伤害降低14%，战斗每持续10秒，额外提升6%减伤，至多叠加5层。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身受到的伤害降低18%，战斗每持续10秒，额外提升7%减伤，至多叠加5层。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","摄人寒意"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","呼唤寒风的保护，进入无敌和免控状态。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时和后续每隔20秒，阿尔娜呼唤寒风环绕保护自身，使自身免疫伤害与控制效果，持续4秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","免疫伤害与控制效果的持续时间提升至5。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","免疫伤害与控制效果的持续时间提升至6。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动释放“摄人寒意”时的效果将同样对“凛冬战士”生效，当阿尔娜或“凛冬战士”的生命值首次低于50%时，将会额外触发一次“摄人寒意”，该效果每人每场战斗中最多触发1次。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","阿尔娜和“凛冬战士”获得属性增益，退出\"摄人寒意\"状态时冻结敌人。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","阿尔娜和“凛冬战士”的基础属性提升15%，持续至其中任意一方被击败。首次退出\"摄人寒意\"状态时，冻结周围1格敌人，持续2秒，并降低目标-50点受愈，持续10秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":15,"tooltip_key":"keyword:basicattr"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","刺骨之寒"]]}